received_works.body:
Hello again, Bellhop🔔さん! Bellhop🔔さん is always great to work with. If it's alright, I would love to request art of my child. 

He is in his late-30s. He has the air of a mature man. Please use a 柴犬 as reference for his ears (and tail if it can be seen). He has the round eyebrows. His hair should have gray streaks. He usually braids it but it isn't required. He has several scars from fighting. Feel free to place them where you like. 

He is a life-long soldier and very good at what he does. 

Despite his serious and grumpy face, he is surprisingly very kind to his friends and loved ones. He is a gentle person who likes small animals and flowers and reading. He is popular with children even if he doesn't understand why. He is クーデレ and has 萌え. He always has a sword.

He's associated with: 
紫陽花; 
ブーゲンビレア; 
wood carvings;
the stars;
sky blue; 
sunny days; 
swords.

Please draw freely in regards to expression and composition. Feel free to change his clothes!

Thank you for considering!

